              "aggregated_output": "Work with AgentTasks\n\nUsage:\n  agentscope task [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  cancel      \n  child       Delegate child work from the current Team leader task\n  complete    Complete the current AgentTask and reconcile its inputs\n  context     Read the authoritative task-scoped collaboration context\n  fail        Fail the current AgentTask with a durable error\n  get         \n  list        \n  progress    Post durable progress for the current AgentTask\n  respond     Post an attributable result for the current AgentTask\n  retry       \n  run         Operate on the Run containing the current AgentTask\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help   help for task\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --api-endpoint string   Control plane REST API endpoint (default \"http://127.0.0.1:18080\")\n      --api-token string      Bearer [REDACTED] for API authentication\n  -n, --namespace string      Kubernetes namespace (default \"default\")\n      --tenant string         Collaboration tenant (default \"default\")\n\nUse \"agentscope task [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n"
